            Primary Action
        </button>
        <button class="hq-glass-card-btn hq-glass-card-btn-secondary">
            Secondary
        </button>
    </div>
</article>
*/

/* ===== USAGE NOTES ===== */

/*
1. BACKGROUND: Place cards over a colorful/patterned background to see the blur effect
2. CUSTOMIZATION: Change --accent-primary to match your brand color
3. IMAGES: Replace the gradient background with actual images using <img> tag
4. OPTIONAL PARTS: Remove tags or subtitle if not needed
5. GRID LAYOUT: Use CSS Grid for multiple cards:

   .card-grid {
       display: grid;
       grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 350px), 1fr));
       gap: var(--space-lg);
   }
*/